OL,3,ACan AI really help spot Black Friday
OL,4,Adeals? We put it to the test
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhether it's scrolling through endless
OL,7,Fchoice, spotting fake reviews, or
OL,8,Fworking out if a "deal" is a deal at
OL,9,Fall, Black Friday sums up a lot of
OL,10,Fonline woes.
OL,12,FRetailers promise bargains - but the
OL,13,Fsheer number of offers can leave us
OL,14,Ffeeling no closer to finding the best
OL,15,Fdeal.
OL,17,FIt's an area where generative AI
OL,18,Fproducts, such as ChatGPT, Claude and
OL,19,FGemini, have promised to help.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
