OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS rapper postpones O2 arena show after
OL,4,AManchester evacuation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I just wanna make sure everyone is
OL,7,Fsafe and the next show goes on
OL,8,Fproperly. My heart and prayers are with
OL,9,Fwith everyone that was injured last
OL,10,Fnight."
OL,12,FToliver is also scheduled to perform at
OL,13,FWembley Arena on Tuesday. No update has
OL,14,Fbeen given about that show.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
