OL,3,APolice investigate unknown substance
OL,4,Athat caused Manchester's Co-op Live
OL,5,Aevacuation
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne person was taken to hospital while
OL,8,Fmore than 80 people were assessed for
OL,9,F"eye and respiratory symptoms", the
OL,10,FNorth West Ambulance Service said.
OL,12,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said a
OL,13,Fmajor incident was declared after
OL,14,Freports of people suffering from the
OL,15,Feffects of an unknown substance, which
OL,16,Fpolice initially believed to be tear
OL,17,Fgas.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
