OL,3,AMiley Cyrus marries Maxx Morando in
OL,4,ACalifornia ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiley Cyrus has married her partner of
OL,7,Ffour years Maxx Morando during a
OL,8,Fceremony in Palm Springs, California.
OL,10,FA string of black and white photos
OL,11,Fshared by the Flowers singer on
OL,12,FInstagram showed the pair kissing while
OL,13,Fsurrounded by white roses.
OL,15,FHer mother, Trisha Cyrus, and sister,
OL,16,FNoah Cyrus, could be seen in the
OL,17,Fbackground of one image. Her father
OL,18,FBilly Ray Cyrus was not in the picture
OL,19,Fbut was at the ceremony with his
OL,20,Fpartner, actress Liz Hurley.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
