OL,3,AMiley Cyrus marries Maxx Morando in
OL,4,ACalifornia ceremony
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrammy-winning Cyrus, 33, wore a white
OL,7,Fsilk dress designed by Anthony
OL,8,FVaccarello for Saint Laurent, while
OL,9,F28-year-old drummer Morando said "I do"
OL,10,Fin a black suit from the same fashion
OL,11,Fhouse.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
