OL,5,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,6,     FIn the first of two episodes, John
OL,7,     FYorke examines Victor Hugo's
OL,8,     Fmagnificent Les Miserables.
OL,9,     FWritten with anger and compassion,
OL,10,     Fit is one of the great novels of
OL,11,     Fthe 19th century.
OL,12,G1500 A Good Read
OL,13,     FLively conversation around three
OL,14,     Fbook choices. Presenter Harriett
OL,15,     FGilbert talks to two guests about
OL,16,     Fbooks they love.
